ube.com/embed/Q55naIp7PCI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>January 20</span><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:30pm</span></div>\n<div class=\"scrnvenue\">At the Curzon Wimbledon (see <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/cibAFgVKJQzUmAxK7\">map</a>)</div>\n<hr />\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Part time farmer Louise Courvoisiers’ debut film, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Holy Cow</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, is centred on a family of struggling farmers in the remote Jura region. Being France, cheese is never far away. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teenage Totone’s (Clément Faveau) carefree drinking and cavorting ways are challenged when he suddenly has to provide for his young sister. The family farm is failing and he manages to get a job in the local dairy, however, that is no way to make ends meet. Can he do so by producing an award winning cheese and so win a competition prize? </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maïwene Barthelemy’s performance is wonderful, as the teenage farmer with whom Totone falls in love. Forcing him to grow up, she challenges his swagger and underlying insecurities. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The stunning countryside of the hills and verdant fields of the Jura is juxtapositioned with hard scrabble rural working class poverty.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cheesemaking scenes are almost handled with reverence, certainly a great respect for the small-scale artisanal way of life.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s a warm hearted coming of age drama with a non professional cast.</span></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8220;Faveau gives an amazingly subtle performance; Totone doesn’t say much but his fragility and complexity are all there, humour too in the little shrug of a shoulder.&#8221; </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Guardian</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8220;<em>[</em></span><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">T</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">]</span></em><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">the filmmaker skewers romantic idylls by depicting the unglamorous realities of working-class country living.&#8221;</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sight and Sound</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (16104):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/&#038;text=Holy+Cow%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Holy Cow%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DAfter the tragic death of his father, 18 year old Totone, played by Clément Faveau, has to care for himself and his 7-year-old sister, and channels his energy into producing an award-winning Comté cheese to claim a competition prize and some much-needed money. Described as a %22verité%22 look at the hardscrabble life of French agriculture, it is simultaneously a moving love story and above all an ode to the love of cheese.%0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=16104\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/image-w856_two_one.jpg\" title=\"Holy Cow\"><img width=\"856\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/image-w856_two_one.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/image-w856_two_one.jpg 856w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/image-w856_two_one-300x150.jpg 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/image-w856_two_one-768x384.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 856px) 100vw, 856px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>2025</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>92 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Louise Courvoisier</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>French (English subtitles)</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>France</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_15_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Comedy, Romance</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Clément Faveau,<br />Maïwene Barthelemy,<br />Luna Garret,<br />Mathis Bertrand,<br />Dimitry Baudry</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Awards:</td>\n<td>Cannes Un Certain Regard – Youth Prize;<br />César Awards:<br />Best First Film,<br />Best Female Revelation (Barthelemy)</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt32086034/\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/holy_cow_2024\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\">\n<style> .buy_button { cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px } .tt-widget-fallback { margin-bottom:18px; }</style>\n<div class=\"tt-widget-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.tickettailor.com/checkout/new-session/id/7388047/chk/043c/\" target=\"_blank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"buy_button\">Buy Tickets</button></a></div>\n<table border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%; margin-top:10px; font-size:12pt; border-style:none; border-color:black; border-collapse:collapse; border-width:thin;\">\n<tr valign=top>\n<td>Member (including lifetime member)</td>\n<td align=right>£8</tr>\n<tr valign=top>\n<td>Member&#8217;s guest</td>\n<td align=right>£12</tr>\n<tr valign=top>\n<td>Non-member *</td>\n<td align=right nowrap>£14</tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">* Non-member tickets booked via Ticket Tailor will also attract a £0.70 booking fee. This is waived for members and guests.</p>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">Tickets booked online can be refunded via Ticket Tailor if you are unable to attend, but only up to 24 hours before the screening. Booking fees for non-member tickets will not be refunded.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">When booking tickets via Ticket Tailor non-members will have the opportunity to opt in to WFC emails re future screenings.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">Carers are eligible for free tickets and the cinema can provide two wheelchair spaces on notice. Please <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/about/contact-us/\">contact us in advance</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">NB: The programme will start sharply at the advertised time (there are no adverts), so please arrive sufficiently early if you wish to buy drinks or snacks from the bar.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:10pt; line-height:1.2;\">We may occasionally take photographs of the audience. If you don&#8217;t wish to be photographed, please inform the photographer or a member of the committee.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<style> p:target {-webkit-animation: target-fade 2s;-moz-animation: target-fade 2s;-o-animation: target-fade 2s;animation: target-fade 2s;}@-webkit-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-moz-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-o-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}</style>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\" id=\"newsletter\">Sign up for the Wimbledon Film Club mailing list to hear about our upcoming screenings.</p>\n\n\n<!-- Begin Mailchimp Signup Form -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t#mc_embed_signup {background:#fff; clear:left; font:14px Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;  width:300px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px;}\n\tlabel {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 5px;}\n\tinput {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 0px;}\n\t#mc-embedded-subscribe {cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:8px 15px 8px 15px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:110px; }\n\tlabel { float:left; }\n\t#mce-EMAIL { width:226px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t#mce-FNAME { width:81px; }\n\t#mce-LNAME { width:120px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t@media only screen and (max-width:360px) { #mce-EMAIL { width:187px; } #mce-FNAME { width:65px } #mce-LNAME { width:96px } #mc_embed_signup { width:260px; } }\n</style>\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.us3.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de&amp;id=141aeb9fdb\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" class=\"validate\" target=\"_blank\" novalidate=\"\">\n    <div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-EMAIL\">Email:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"EMAIL\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-FNAME\">Name:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"FNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-FNAME\">\n\t<label for=\"mce-LNAME\"></label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"LNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-LNAME\"></div>\n</div>\n\t<div id=\"mce-responses\" class=\"clear\