lt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@wimbledonfilm\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/threads.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f843088e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f56b541 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:680px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize; padding-left:10px;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-system-font-font-family\">Santosh</h3></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a4a2463 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;flex-basis:330px\"><style type=\"text/css\"> .navigation { overflow:auto; padding:0 10px 5px; border-radius:5px; line-height:1.5; border:1px solid #498A2B; font-size:12pt; } .left { float:left; width:85px; } .mid { float:left; } .right { float:right; }@media only screen and (max-width: 350px) { .navigation { font-size:10pt; } span.hide { display:none; } }@media only screen and (max-width: 1199px) { .navigation { font-size:11pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1549px) { span.hide { display:none; } }</style>\n<div class=\"navigation\"><span class=\"left\">&laquo; <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\" title=\"Holy Cow\">Previous</a></span><span class=\"mid\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/chungking-express/\" title=\"Chungking Express\">Next</a> &raquo;</span><span class=\"right\"><a href=\"/\">Back<span class=\"hide\"> to homepage</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:408px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<main class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-eaad8fc0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:-10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2896b766 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:680px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div>\n<style>.auto-resizable-iframe { max-width: 660px; max-height: 360px; margin: 0px auto; }.auto-resizable-iframe > div { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56%; height: 0px; }.auto-resizable-iframe iframe { position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; }</style>\n<div class=\"auto-resizable-iframe\">\n<div><iframe title=\"SANTOSH trailer | BFI London Film Festival 2024\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_9pmVqcMbcc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>February 3</span><a href=\"/index-members-choice/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"background-color:gold; color:black; padding: 0 10px; border-radius:5px;\">Members&#8217; Choice</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:30pm</span></div>\n<div class=\"scrnvenue\">At the Curzon Wimbledon (see <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/cibAFgVKJQzUmAxK7\">map</a>)</div>\n<hr />\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sandhya Suri’s feature debut, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Santosh</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, is a muscular Hindi-language police procedural set in rural north India. Elegantly scripted by the British-Indian former documentary maker, the film combines gripping storytelling with a sharp awareness of modern India’s darker realities: police corruption and brutality, entrenched sexism, caste prejudice and anti-Muslim sentiment. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The film follows its newly widowed protagonist, Santosh (Shahana Goswami), who is offered her late husband’s police job through a government scheme. The role grants her independence from her oppressive in-laws and fosters a growing sense of self-worth. Calm, diligent and serious, she proves naturally suited to the work.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When the murder of a Dalit girl threatens to inflame local tensions, veteran officer Geeta (Sunita Rajwar) recruits Santosh as her deputy. It soon becomes clear this promotion is a dubious honour. Geeta’s charisma and ruthlessness command respect, but her methods and motives are troublingly opaque. Through Goswami’s quietly intelligent performance, the film suggests that a case being closed does not necessarily mean justice has been served.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Selected as the UK’s submission for the international Oscar category, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Santosh</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> has yet to be released in India due to censorship issues. </span></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“As well as working rivetingly as a procedural thriller and a psychological study, Santosh has a hard, documentary-like edge, exploring Indian social phenomena with intense analytical focus.”</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Financial Times</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (16109):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/santosh/&#038;text=Santosh%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/santosh/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/santosh/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/santosh/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Santosh%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DA young newly widowed Hindu inherits her late husband’s police constable job in the rural badlands of Northern India and is soon pulled into a murder investigation under the wing of charismatic feminist inspector Sharma.%0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/santosh/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=16109\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/santosh-2024-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg\" title=\"Santosh\"><img width=\"831\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/santosh-2024-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/santosh-2024-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg 831w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/santosh-2024-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter-300x142.jpg 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/santosh-2024-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter-768x364.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 831px) 100vw, 831px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>2025</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>125 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Sandhya Suri</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>Hindi (English subtitles)</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>France, Germany, India, UK</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_15_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Crime, Drama</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Shahana Goswami,<br />Sunita Rajwar,<br />Nawal Shukla,<br />Kushal Dubey,<br />Sanjay Bishnoi,<br />Prashant Kumar</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Awards:</td>\n<td>BIFA Best Screenplay and Breakthrough Producer</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt30444418/?ref_=fn_i_1\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/santosh_2024\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\"><button style=\"background-color:orange; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px\" type=\"button\">Not Yet On Sale</button></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt\">Tickets go on sale to members on January 21, and to non-members on January 24. If you would like to be alerted, sign-up below.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<style> p:target {-webkit-animation: target-fade 2s;-moz-animation: target-fade 2s;-o-animation: target-fade 2s;animation: target-fade 2s;}@-webkit-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-moz-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-o-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}</style>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\" id=\"newsletter\">Sign up for the Wimbledon Film Club mailing list to hear about our upcoming screenings.</p>\n\n\n<!-- Begin Mailchimp Signup Form -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t#mc_embed_signup {background:#fff; clear:left; font:14px Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;  width:300px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px;}\n\tlabel {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 5px;}\n\tinput {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 0px;}\n\t#mc-embedded-subscribe {cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:8px 15px 8px 15px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:110px; }\n\tlabel { float:left; }\n\t#mce-EMAIL { width:226px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t#mce-FNAME { width:81px; }\n\t#mce-LNAME { width:120px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t@media only screen and (max-width:360px) { #mce-EMAIL { width:187px; } #mce-FNAME { width:65px } #mce-LNAME { width:96px } #mc_embed_signup { width:260px; } }\n</style>\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.us3.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de&amp;id=141aeb9fdb\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" class=\"validate\" target=\"_blank\" novalidate=\"\">\n    <div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-EMAIL\">Email:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"EMAIL\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-FNAME\">Name:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"FNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-FNAME\">\n\t<label for=\"mce-LNAME\"></label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"LNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-LNAME\"></div>\n</div>\n\t<div id=\"mce-responses\" class=\"clear\">\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-error-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-success-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t</div>    <!-- real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot signups-->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -5000px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"b_258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de_141aeb9fdb\" tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"\"></div>\n    <div style=\"width:100%; background-color:#fff; padding-bottom:5px; overflow:hidden;\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%;\">\n\t\t<span style=\"margin:20px 0px 0px 5px; float:left; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic;\">All fields are required</span>\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-right:12px; float:right;\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Subscribe\" name=\"subscribe\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe\"></span>\n\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    </div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n<!--End mc_embed_signup-->\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#4caf50;color:#4caf50\"/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#4d4e53;color:#4d4e53\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-style:italic; width:51pt\">Season:</td>\n<td style=\"font-size:13pt\"><a href=\"/category/2025-26\">2025-26</a></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-style:italic; vertical-align:top;\">Tags:</td>\n<td><a href=\"/tag/class-15\">Classification: 15</a>, <a href=\"/tag/country-france\">Country: France</a>, <a href=\"/tag/country-germany\">Country: Germany</a>, <a href=\"/tag/country-india\">Country: India</a>, <a href=\"/tag/country-uk\">Country: UK</a>, <a href=\"/tag/genre-crime\">Genre: Crime</a>, <a href=\"/tag/genre-drama\">Genre: Drama</a>, <a href=\"/tag/language-hindi\">Language: Hindi</a>, <a href=\"/tag/members-choice\">Members&#8217; Choice</a>, <a href=\"/tag/subtitles\">Subtitles</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;background-color:#4d4e53;color:#4d4e53\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1f0d5fce wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:68px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:0.8rem\">Published: </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:250px\"><div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\" class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2025-12-23T14:54:14+00:00\">23 December 2025 14:54</time></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n\n\n<footer class=\"wp-block-template-part\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-bc641d55 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#4d4e53;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cb46ffcb wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6c531013 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\"><img width=\"70\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://wimbledo