al\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/bluesky.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@wimbledonfilm\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/threads.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f843088e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f56b541 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:680px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize; padding-left:10px;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-system-font-font-family\">All That Heaven Allows</h3></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a4a2463 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;flex-basis:330px\"><style type=\"text/css\"> .navigation { overflow:auto; padding:0 10px 5px; border-radius:5px; line-height:1.5; border:1px solid #498A2B; font-size:12pt; } .left { float:left; width:85px; } .mid { float:left; } .right { float:right; }@media only screen and (max-width: 350px) { .navigation { font-size:10pt; } span.hide { display:none; } }@media only screen and (max-width: 1199px) { .navigation { font-size:11pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1549px) { span.hide { display:none; } }</style>\n<div class=\"navigation\"><span class=\"left\">&laquo; <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/chungking-express/\" title=\"Chungking Express\">Previous</a></span><span class=\"mid\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/\" title=\"Souleymane’s Story\">Next</a> &raquo;</span><span class=\"right\"><a href=\"/\">Back<span class=\"hide\"> to homepage</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:408px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<main class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-eaad8fc0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:-10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2896b766 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:680px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div>\n<style>.auto-resizable-iframe { max-width: 660px; max-height: 360px; margin: 0px auto; }.auto-resizable-iframe > div { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56%; height: 0px; }.auto-resizable-iframe iframe { position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; }</style>\n<div class=\"auto-resizable-iframe\">\n<div><iframe title=\"All That Heaven Allows (1955) ORIGINAL TRAILER [HD 1080p]\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3H8yXanHW1I?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>March 10</span><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:30pm</span></div>\n<div class=\"scrnvenue\">At the Curzon Wimbledon (see <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/cibAFgVKJQzUmAxK7\">map</a>)</div>\n<hr />\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; border-style:solid; padding:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-size: 11pt; text-align:center\">Q&#038;A with Emeritus Professor Peter Evans</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Superficially a melodrama that owes more to Mills &amp; Boon than German Expressionism, the Hamburg-born Douglas Sirk’s second film with the pairing of Jane Wyman and Rock Hudson, after 1954’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Magnificent Obsession</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, has proved remarkably influential, inspiring films as diverse as Rainer Werner Fassbinder’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ali: Fear Eats the Soul</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (1974) and Todd Haynes’ </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Far From Heaven</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (2002). </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flipping the conventions of the May-September romance by having an older woman fall for a younger man, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All That Heaven Allows</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a film about social non-conformism that prefigures many of the themes of the 1960s despite its strait-laced appearance. Hudson’s character Ron is not only an arborist at ease with nature, but an avid reader of the philosopher Henry David Thoreau who introduces Wyman’s character Cary to a more culturally and emotionally diverse, even Bohemian, circle. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Subsequent readings of the film have emphasised the queer subtext (at one point, Cary asks Ron if he would like her as a man), the saturated colours and symbolism of the visuals, and the subtle irony at work. The over-riding theme is captured in Ron’s quotation of Shakespeare: “To thine own self be true.”</span></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“Everything you want from a tumultuous weepy is here: hard, breathless kisses; big, brave declarations of violent, undying love; battle-weary, star-crossed lovers who meet obstacles at every turn. But Sirk surpasses melodramatic cliches by securing an exceptional performance from Wyman, whose soft face, as watchful and nervously expectant as a child&#8217;s, is capti­vating through­out, subtly registering every chink of hope and approa­ching black cloud. This is her, and Sirk&#8217;s finest hour.” </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jane Graham</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, The Guardian (</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2010</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">)</span></i></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“[W]ith Sirk the style conceals the message. His interiors are wildly over the top, and his exteriors are phony – he wants you to notice the artifice, to see that he’s not using realism but an exaggerated Hollywood studio style.” </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rober Ebert</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, rogerebert.com (</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1998</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">)</span></i></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (16127):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/&#038;text=All+That+Heaven+Allows%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=All That Heaven Allows%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DAll That Heaven Allows turns the ‘May-December’ romance on its head as attractive widow Cary Scott (Jane Wyman) falls in love with the younger, handsome gardener Ron Kirby (Rock Hudson).%0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=16127\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec.png\" title=\"All That Heaven Allows\"><img width=\"1167\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec.png 1167w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec-300x180.png 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec-1024x614.png 1024w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/5-All-that-Heaven-Allows-landscape-updated-23-Dec-768x461.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1167px) 100vw, 1167px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>1955</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>89 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Douglas Silk</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>English</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>USA</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_U_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Drama</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Jane Wyman,<br />Rock Hudson,<br />Agnes Moorehead,<br />Conrad Nagel,<br />Virginia Grey</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0047811/?ref_=fn_t_1\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/all_that_heaven_allows\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\"><button style=\"background-color:orange; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px\" type=\"button\">Not Yet On Sale</button></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt\">Tickets go on sale to members on February 25, and to non-members on February 28. If you would like to be alerted, sign-up below.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<style> p:target {-webkit-animation: target-fade 2s;-moz-animation: target-fade 2s;-o-animation: target-fade 2s;animation: target-fade 2s;}@-webkit-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-moz-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-o-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}</style>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\" id=\"newsletter\">Sign up for the Wimbledon Film Club mailing list to hear about our upcoming screenings.</p>\n\n\n<!-- Begin Mailchimp Signup Form -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t#mc_embed_signup {background:#fff; clear:left; font:14px Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;  width:300px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px;}\n\tlabel {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 5px;}\n\tinput {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 0px;}\n\t#mc-embedded-subscribe {cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:8px 15px 8px 15px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:110px; }\n\tlabel { float:left; }\n\t#mce-EMAIL { width:226px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t#mce-FNAME { width:81px; }\n\t#mce-LNAME { width:120px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t@media only screen and (max-width:360px) { #mce-EMAIL { width:187px; } #mce-FNAME { width:65px } #mce-LNAME { width:96px } #mc_embed_signup { width:260px; } }\n</style>\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.us3.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de&amp;id=141aeb9fdb\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" class=\"validate\" target=\"_blank\" novalidate=\"\">\n    <div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-EMAIL\">Email:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"EMAIL\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-FNAME\">Name:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"FNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-FNAME\">\n\t<label for=\"mce-LNAME\"></label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"LNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-LNAME\"></div>\n</div>\n\t<div id=\"mce-responses\" class=\"clear\">\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-error-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-success-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t</div>    <!-- real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot signups-->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -5000px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"b_258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de_141aeb9fdb\" tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"\"></div>\n    <div style=\"width:100%; background-color:#fff; padding-bottom:5px; overflow:hidden;\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%;\">\n\t\t<span style=\"margin:20px 0px 0px 5px; float:left; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic;\">All fields are required</span>\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-right:12px; float:right;\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Subscribe\" name=\"subscribe\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe\"></span>\n\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    </div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n<!--End mc_embed_signup-->\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#4caf50;color:#4caf50\"/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-bl