</li><li class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/become-member/\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">Become a Member</span></a></li><li class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/archive/\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">Search</span></a></li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-d6743c7d wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><style type=\"text/css\"> div.smi_head { text-align:center; }  img.adjusth, img.adjusth2 { display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; } @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { img.adjusth { height:30px; } img.adjusth2 { height:23px; margin:2px 3px 0; } }  @media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { img.adjusth { height:40px; margin:0 2px; } img.adjusth2 { height:30px; margin:0 5px; } } </style>\n<div class=\"smi_head\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wimbledonfilm/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WimbledonFilmClub/?fref=nf\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/WFCscreenings\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/wimbledonfilmclub.bsky.social\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/bluesky.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@wimbledonfilm\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/threads.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f843088e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f56b541 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:680px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize; padding-left:10px;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-system-font-font-family\">Souleymane’s Story</h3></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a4a2463 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;flex-basis:330px\"><style type=\"text/css\"> .navigation { overflow:auto; padding:0 10px 5px; border-radius:5px; line-height:1.5; border:1px solid #498A2B; font-size:12pt; } .left { float:left; width:85px; } .mid { float:left; } .right { float:right; }@media only screen and (max-width: 350px) { .navigation { font-size:10pt; } span.hide { display:none; } }@media only screen and (max-width: 1199px) { .navigation { font-size:11pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1549px) { span.hide { display:none; } }</style>\n<div class=\"navigation\"><span class=\"left\">&laquo; <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/all-that-heaven-allows/\" title=\"All That Heaven Allows\">Previous</a></span><span class=\"right\"><a href=\"/\">Back<span class=\"hide\"> to homepage</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:408px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<main class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-eaad8fc0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:-10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2896b766 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:680px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div>\n<style>.auto-resizable-iframe { max-width: 660px; max-height: 360px; margin: 0px auto; }.auto-resizable-iframe > div { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56%; height: 0px; }.auto-resizable-iframe iframe { position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; }</style>\n<div class=\"auto-resizable-iframe\">\n<div><iframe title=\"THE STORY OF SOULEYMANE - Official HD Trailer - Only In Cinemas\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rbs53_uMw9o?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>March 17</span><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:30pm</span></div>\n<div class=\"scrnvenue\">At the Curzon Wimbledon (see <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/cibAFgVKJQzUmAxK7\">map</a>)</div>\n<hr />\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p>Souleymane, a Paris food delivery cyclist and asylum seeker has two days to prepare his story for a make-or-break interview to secure legal residency.</p>\n<p>Ben Nicholson in <em>Sight and Sound</em> said “As the script teases out the details of what he’s been through, it acutely humanises this young single male who has come to Europe in a boat. The effect is profound”.</p>\n<p>Sam Leigh, <em>Financial Times</em> film critic said, “the movie comes to rest with a closing scene that is impossible to shake”.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (16135):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/&#038;text=Souleymane%E2%80%99s+Story%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Souleymane’s Story%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DSouleymane, a Paris food delivery cyclist and asylum seeker has two days to prepare his story for a make-or-break interview to secure legal residency.%0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/souleymanes-story/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=16135\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a.png\" title=\"Souleymane’s Story\"><img width=\"1052\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a.png 1052w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a-300x200.png 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a-1024x681.png 1024w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/6-Souleymanes-Story-landscape-v3a-768x511.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1052px) 100vw, 1052px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>2025</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>94 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Boris Lojkine</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>French (English subtitles)</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>France</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_12A_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Drama</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Abou Sangare,<br />Alpha Oumar Sow,<br />Nina Meurisse</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Awards:</td>\n<td>Cannes 3 awards:<br />Un Certain Regard – Jury Prize,<br />Un Certain Regard – Best Performance (Sangaré),<br />and FIPRESCI Prize. 4 César awards.</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt32086046/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_1_tt_6_nm_1_in_0_q_souleman%27s%2520\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/souleymanes_story\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\"><button style=\"background-color:orange; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px\" type=\"button\">Not Yet On Sale</button></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt\">Tickets go on sale to members on March 4, and to non-members on March 7. If you would like to be alerted, sign-up below.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<style> p:target {-webkit-animation: target-fade 2s;-moz-animation: target-fade 2s;-o-animation: target-fade 2s;animation: target-fade 2s;}@-webkit-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-moz-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-o-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}</style>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\" id=\"newsletter\">Sign up for the Wimbledon Film Club mailing list to hear about our upcoming screenings.</p>\n\n\n<!-- Begin Mailchimp Signup Form -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t#mc_embed_signup {background:#fff; clear:left; font:14px Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;  width:300px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px;}\n\tlabel {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 5px;}\n\tinput {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 0px;}\n\t#mc-embedded-subscribe {cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:8px 15px 8px 15px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:110px; }\n\tlabel { float:left; }\n\t#mce-EMAIL { width:226px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t#mce-FNAME { width:81px; }\n\t#mce-LNAME { width:120px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t@media only screen and (max-width:360px) { #mce-EMAIL { width:187px; } #mce-FNAME { width:65px } #mce-LNAME { width:96px } #mc_embed_signup { width:260px; } }\n</style>\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.us3.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de&amp;id=141aeb9fdb\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" class=\"validate\" target=\"_blank\" novalidate=\"\">\n    <div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-EMAIL\">Email:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"EMAIL\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-FNAME\">Name:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"FNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-FNAME\">\n\t<label for=\"mce-LNAME\"></label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"LNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-LNAME\"></div>\n</div>\n\t<div id=\"mce-responses\" class=\"clear\">\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-error-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-success-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t</div>    <!-- real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot signups-->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -500