ps://bsky.app/profile/wimbledonfilmclub.bsky.social\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/bluesky.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@wimbledonfilm\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/threads.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f843088e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f56b541 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:680px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize; padding-left:10px;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-system-font-font-family\">Vermiglio</h3></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a4a2463 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;flex-basis:330px\"><style type=\"text/css\"> .navigation { overflow:auto; padding:0 10px 5px; border-radius:5px; line-height:1.5; border:1px solid #498A2B; font-size:12pt; } .left { float:left; width:85px; } .mid { float:left; } .right { float:right; }@media only screen and (max-width: 350px) { .navigation { font-size:10pt; } span.hide { display:none; } }@media only screen and (max-width: 1199px) { .navigation { font-size:11pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1549px) { span.hide { display:none; } }</style>\n<div class=\"navigation\"><span class=\"left\">&laquo; <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/chuck-chuck-baby/\" title=\"Chuck Chuck Baby\">Previous</a></span><span class=\"mid\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/bright-star/\" title=\"Bright Star\">Next</a> &raquo;</span><span class=\"right\"><a href=\"/\">Back<span class=\"hide\"> to homepage</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:408px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<main class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-eaad8fc0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:-10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2896b766 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:680px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div>\n<style>.auto-resizable-iframe { max-width: 660px; max-height: 360px; margin: 0px auto; }.auto-resizable-iframe > div { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56%; height: 0px; }.auto-resizable-iframe iframe { position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; }</style>\n<div class=\"auto-resizable-iframe\">\n<div><iframe title=\"VERMIGLIO - Official Trailer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/701RfY55ppQ?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>October 14, 2025</span><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:00pm</span></div>\n<hr />\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maura Delpero’s second feature film (after </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maternal, </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">focusing on young single mothers living in hostels run by nuns) is a slow-burn family saga set in 1944. Beautifully acted by a cast mixing actors and non-professionals, Martina Scrinzi particularly shines as the family’s eldest daughter Lucia &#8211; her performance won her an award at the prestigious Venice Film Festival. The film is gorgeously shot by cinematographer Mikhail Krichman (DoP for </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leviathan, </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">also shown by WFC), whose rarely moving camera evokes both paintings and the theatre.  </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The film was inspired by a dream Delpero had about her father as a child, playing with his nine siblings in their childhood home Vermiglio, a village high in the Italian Alps.  While its high elevation and distance from urban conurbations enabled Vermiglio to avoid the horrors of WW2, the film depicts a period of great change for the family, the local community, and Italy as a whole. Delpero’s extended family contributed memories to weave into the film &#8211; the romance at the centre of the film is based on one that happened within her family.   </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The village of Vermiglio celebrated the opening of the film with a big party. Delpero comments that this is “</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">because the village itself participated in the movie.  Everyone has a sister or an aunt that was in the film. … I was very respectful. I was not going there with the big cinema machine. That makes the difference.”</span></i></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“Immense subtlety and quiet observation … a peculiar three-way push-pull between phenomenal restraint, whispered yearning and bitter resentment.”  </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nick James, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sight and Sound </span></i></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“A rich, enveloping film that asks viewers to approach it as if tiptoeing through the snow.” </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ben Konigsberg, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">New York Times</span></i></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (13285):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/vermiglio/&#038;text=Vermiglio%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/vermiglio/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/vermiglio/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/vermiglio/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Vermiglio%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DEveryday life in a remote Alpine village during WW2 is profoundly disrupted by the arrival of a Sicilian stranger.  This painterly rural drama from Maura Delpero won the Venice Silver Lion, and was Italy’s submission to the Academy Awards. %0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/vermiglio/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=13285\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg\" title=\"Vermiglio\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter.jpg 1280w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter-300x169.jpg 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/vermiglio-catalogue-picture-01-web-ezgif.com-webp-to-jpg-converter-768x432.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>2024</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>119 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Maura Delpero</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>Italian (English subtitles)</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>Italy</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_15_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Drama</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Tommaso Ragno,<br />Roberta Rovelli,<br />Martina Scrinzi,<br />Carlotta Gamba</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Awards:</td>\n<td>Italian Academy Awards:<br />Best Film,<br />Best Director &#038; Best Original Screenplay;<br />Venice Film Festival:<br />Silver Lion,<br />Grand Jury Prize,<br />Best Young Actress &#038; Best Italian Film</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt28618488/?ref_=ttawd_ov_bk\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/vermiglio\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scoreboard\">\n<div class=\"starlabel\">WFC Audience Score:&nbsp;&nbsp;75%</div>\n<div class=\"starline\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/grey-star.png\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\"><button onclick=\"window.location.href='/archive/'\" style=\"cursor: pointer; background-color:blue; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px\" type=\"button\">Search the Archive</button></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt\">View our 387 screenings by season, country, language and other dimensions.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<style> p:target {-webkit-animation: target-fade 2s;-moz-animation: target-fade 2s;-o-animation: target-fade 2s;animation: target-fade 2s;}@-webkit-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-moz-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@-o-keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}@keyframes target-fade {from { background-color: red; } /* [1] */to { background-color: transparent; }}</style>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\" id=\"newsletter\">Sign up for the Wimbledon Film Club mailing list to hear about our upcoming screenings.</p>\n\n\n<!-- Begin Mailchimp Signup Form -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t#mc_embed_signup {background:#fff; clear:left; font:14px Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;  width:300px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px;}\n\tlabel {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 5px;}\n\tinput {line-height:1; margin:12px 0px 5px 0px;}\n\t#mc-embedded-subscribe {cursor: pointer; background-color:#498a2b; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:8px 15px 8px 15px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:110px; }\n\tlabel { float:left; }\n\t#mce-EMAIL { width:226px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t#mce-FNAME { width:81px; }\n\t#mce-LNAME { width:120px; float:right; margin-right:12px;}\n\t@media only screen and (max-width:360px) { #mce-EMAIL { width:187px; } #mce-FNAME { width:65px } #mce-LNAME { width:96px } #mc_embed_signup { width:260px; } }\n</style>\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.us3.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de&amp;id=141aeb9fdb\" method=\"post\" autocomplete=\"on\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" class=\"validate\" target=\"_blank\" novalidate=\"\">\n    <div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-EMAIL\">Email:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"EMAIL\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mc-field-group\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%; vertical-align:text-top;\"><label for=\"mce-FNAME\">Name:&nbsp;</label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"FNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-FNAME\">\n\t<label for=\"mce-LNAME\"></label>\n\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"LNAME\" class=\"\" id=\"mce-LNAME\"></div>\n</div>\n\t<div id=\"mce-responses\" class=\"clear\">\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-error-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-success-response\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\t</div>    <!-- real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot signups-->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; left: -5000px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"b_258b97ba9c4142f4b835ae1de_141aeb9fdb\" tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"\"></div>\n    <div style=\"width:100%; background-color:#fff; padding-bottom:5px; overflow:hidden;\">\n\t<div style=\"display:inline-block; width:100%;\">\n\t\t<span style=\"margin:20px 0px 0px 5px; float:left; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic;\">All fields are required</span>\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-right:12px; float:right;\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Subscribe\" name=\"subscribe\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe\"></span>\n\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    </div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n<!--End mc_embed_signup-->\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#4caf50;color:#4caf50\"/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:16pt;\">Screening Gallery</span></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:11pt; font-style:italic;\">\n<div style=\"margin:0px; border-style:none; padding:0 0 10px 0;\"><a href=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3416.jpg title=\"Richard Hilton, Gill McCall, Clare Collins, Andrew Shipton, Dave Timoney and Pauline Mullin\"><img src=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3416.jpg width=\"300px\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"width:300px; margin-top:-13px;\"><span>Richard Hilton, Gill McCall, Clare Collins, Andrew Shipton, Dave Timoney and Pauline Mullin</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:0px; border-style:none; padding:0 0 10px 0;\"><a href=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3445.jpg title=\"Former Chair Clare Collins and current Chair Andrew Shipton\"><img src=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3445.jpg width=\"300px\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"width:300px; margin-top:-13px;\"><span>Former Chair Clare Collins and current Chair Andrew Shipton</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:0px; border-style:none; padding:0 0 10px 0;\"><a href=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3412.jpg title=\"Former Chair Clare Collins with longtime club members Dave Johnson and Gill McCall\"><img src=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/U50A3412.jpg width=\"300px\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"width:300px; margin-top:-13px;\"><span>Former Chair Clare Collins with longtime club members Dave Johnson and Gill McCall</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:0px; border-style:none; padding:0 0 10px 0;\"><a href=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Cecilia-and-Clare-Collins-at-Vermiglio-Oct-2025.jpeg title=\"Volunteer photographer Cecilia Burnette and former Chair Clare Collins\"><img src=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Cecilia-and-Clare-Collins-at-Vermiglio-Oct-2025.jpeg width=\"300px\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"wi