FCscreenings\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/wimbledonfilmclub.bsky.social\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/bluesky.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@wimbledonfilm\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"adjusth2\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/threads.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f843088e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f56b541 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:680px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize; padding-left:10px;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-system-font-font-family\">Picnic at Hanging Rock</h3></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4a4a2463 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;flex-basis:330px\"><style type=\"text/css\"> .navigation { overflow:auto; padding:0 10px 5px; border-radius:5px; line-height:1.5; border:1px solid #498A2B; font-size:12pt; } .left { float:left; width:85px; } .mid { float:left; } .right { float:right; }@media only screen and (max-width: 350px) { .navigation { font-size:10pt; } span.hide { display:none; } }@media only screen and (max-width: 1199px) { .navigation { font-size:11pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1549px) { span.hide { display:none; } }</style>\n<div class=\"navigation\"><span class=\"left\">&laquo; <a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/the-man-without-a-past/\" title=\"The Man Without a Past\">Previous</a></span><span class=\"mid\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/holy-cow/\" title=\"Holy Cow\">Next</a> &raquo;</span><span class=\"right\"><a href=\"/\">Back<span class=\"hide\"> to homepage</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:408px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<main class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-eaad8fc0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:-10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns break-1200 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2896b766 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column widen-1200 has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:680px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div>\n<style>.auto-resizable-iframe { max-width: 660px; max-height: 360px; margin: 0px auto; }.auto-resizable-iframe > div { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56%; height: 0px; }.auto-resizable-iframe iframe { position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; }</style>\n<div class=\"auto-resizable-iframe\">\n<div><iframe title=\"PICNIC AT HANGING ROCK - 4K Restoration Trailer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4RAbCyrQXbY?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">div.scrndate { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: top; font-weight:500; }hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; }@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:12pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:10pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 600px) { div.scrndate { font-size:16pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) { div.scrndate { font-size:20pt; } div.scrnvenue { font-size:14pt; } }</style>\n<div class=\"scrndate\"><span>January 6</span><span style=\"white-space:pre; padding-left:5px;\">8:30pm</span></div>\n<hr />\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; border-style:solid; padding:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-size: 11pt; text-align:center\">4K restoration issued in 2025 to mark the film&#8217;s 50th anniversary</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"entry-content wp-block-post-content is-layout-flow wp-block-post-content-is-layout-flow\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Based on the 1967 novel by Joan Lindsay, Peter Weir’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Picnic at Hanging Rock</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is both a mystery on the scale of geological time and the product of a specific moment in the flowering of Australian cinema in the 1970s. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Australia’s New Wave combined historical drama, Gothic horror and a new appreciation of the country’s physical and social complexity in films as varied as Weir’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Cars That Ate Paris</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (1974), George Miller’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mad Ma</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">x and Gillian Armstrong’s </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">My Brilliant Career</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (both 1979), but it unquestionably reached a peak in this entirely fictional tale of a group of schoolgirls who disappear on a trip to an extinct volcano: a real location in Victoria, often used for rock concerts.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The sensual and troubling atmosphere that Weir skillfully evokes has proved a lasting influence not only on other filmmakers but on forms as diverse as fashion photography and music videos. The film’s sense of languor and mystery is helped by a soundtrack that includes both classical music and the haunting airs of Romanian pan-pipes. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“We worked very hard,” Weir told an interviewer for </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sight &amp; Sound</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, “at creating an hallucinatory, mesmeric rhythm, so that you lost awareness of facts, you stopped adding things up, and got into this enclosed atmosphere. I did everything in my power to hypnotize the audience away from the possibility of solutions.”</span></p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“Peter Weir’s eerie and lugubrious mystery chiller from 1975, adapted by screenwriter Cliff Green from the novel by Joan Lindsay, is now rereleased for its 50th anniversary. It’s a supernatural parable of imperial anxiety and sexual hysteria”. </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Peter Bradshaw</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, Guardian (2025)</span></i></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> hr { border-top:1px solid #498A2B; margin:10px 0; } .share-container { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:10pt; margin:10px 0; } .share-left { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; text-wrap:nowrap; } .share-middle { float:left; margin-right:20px; } .share-right1 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 6px 5px 0; } .share-right2 { float:left; font-size:10pt; margin:4px 100px 0 4px; } img { vertical-align:top; }</style>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"share-container\">\n<div class=\"share-left\">Share this film (16027):</div>\n<div class=\"share-middle\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/picnic-at-hanging-rock/&#038;text=Picnic+at+Hanging+Rock%20-%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/twitter_x.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/picnic-at-hanging-rock/\" class=\"fb-xfbml-parse-ignore\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" width=30px></a><a href=\"whatsapp://send?text=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/picnic-at-hanging-rock/\" data-action=\"share/whatsapp/share\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/whatsapp.png\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" width=30px></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/picnic-at-hanging-rock/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=30px></a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Picnic at Hanging Rock%20at%20the%20Wimbledon%20Film%20Club&#038;body=%0D%0A%0DDirected by Peter Weir, Picnic at Hanging Rock is a 1975 Australian mystery film involves the disappearance of several schoolgirls and their teacher during a picnic at Hanging Rock, Victoria on Valentine's Day in 1900, and the subsequent effect on the local community.%0A%0D%0Ahttps://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/picnic-at-hanging-rock/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/email.png\" alt=\"Email\" width=30px></a></div>\n<div class=\"share-right1\">Click for the WFC poster:</div>\n<div class=\"share-right2\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/poster/wfc_poster.php?film_id=16027\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/icons/share/wfc.png\" alt=\"WFC\" width=22px></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:320px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-Picture-at-hanging-rock-e1766515282666.png\" title=\"Picnic at Hanging Rock\"><img width=\"797\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-Picture-at-hanging-rock-e1766515282666.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-Picture-at-hanging-rock-e1766515282666.png 797w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-Picture-at-hanging-rock-e1766515282666-300x177.png 300w, https://wimbledonfilmclub.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1-Picture-at-hanging-rock-e1766515282666-768x453.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px\" /></a></figure>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.box { display:inline; }\ntable { padding-bottom:15px; }\ntr { vertical-align:top; }\n.bbfc { vertical-align:middle; }\n.scoreboard { width:auto; border:1px solid #498a2b; padding:5px; margin:20px 0px; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; }\n.starlabel { font-size:16pt; padding:5px 0; }\n.starline { padding:5px 0 10px; }\nimg.starpic { vertical-align: middle; padding:0; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 360px) { .starlabel { font-size:13pt; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:500; font-size:20pt\">Film Information</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0 valign=top width=100%>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Release year:</td>\n<td>1975</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Running time:&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>115 mins</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Directed by:</td>\n<td>Peter Weir</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Language:</td>\n<td>English</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Country:</td>\n<td>Australia</tr>\n<tr>\n<td nowrap>Classification:</td>\n<td><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bbfc\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bbfc/BBFC_12A_2019.svg.png\"></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genre:</td>\n<td>Drama</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starring:</td>\n<td>Rachel Roberts,<br />Dominic Guard,<br />Helen Morse,<br />Vivean Gray,<br />Jacki Weaver</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More info: </p>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0073540/\">IMDb</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/picnic_at_hanging_rock\">Rotten Tomatoes</a></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scoreboard\">\n<div class=\"starlabel\">WFC Audience Score:&nbsp;&nbsp;80%</div>\n<div class=\"starline\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/full-star.png\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"starpic\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stars/grey-star.png\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;padding-top:18px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;flex-basis:400px\"><div class=\"wp-block-template-part\"><div style=\"display:inline;\"><button onclick=\"window.location.href='/archive/'\" style=\"cursor: pointer; background-color:blue; border:none; border-radius: 6px; color:white; padding:15px 22px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; width:200px\" type=\"button\">Search the Archive</button></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12pt\">View our 387 screenings by season, country, language and other dimensions.</div>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid #498A2B\">\n\n\n<sty